<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Nestle Q2 net up three pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Nestle Q2 net up three pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited consolidated results for the second quarter ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  Q2 1996	    Q2 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,421.56   vs    1,196.15</p>
<p>    Net profit		  75.93   vs	 73.69</p>
<p>    Tax			   41.50   vs	 32.90</p>
<p>NOTE - Nestle Lanka Ltd manufactures food products under licence from Nestle SA Vevery Switzerland and consolidates results with Ceylon Nutritional Foods.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
